---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for The Focus Dividend. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit our website."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-readable px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Last updated: February 2026
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        The Focus Dividend (&quot;we,&quot; &quot;our,&quot; or &quot;us&quot;) operates focus-dividend.com. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        We may collect information about you when you visit our website, including:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600">
        <li><strong>Automatically collected data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device type, pages visited, time and date of visits, and referring URLs.</li>
        <li><strong>Information you provide:</strong> If you contact us, subscribe to our newsletter, or interact with our site, we may collect your name and email address.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        We use cookies and similar technologies to improve your experience and analyze site traffic. We use:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600">
        <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> To understand how visitors use our site and improve our content.</li>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> To display relevant advertisements. AdSense may use cookies and collect data for personalized ads. You can learn more at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" class="text-gray-700 underline hover:text-gray-900" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google&apos;s Advertising Policy</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect site functionality.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        We use collected information to:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600">
        <li>Operate and improve our website</li>
        <li>Analyze traffic and usage patterns</li>
        <li>Display relevant advertisements</li>
        <li>Respond to your inquiries</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        We use third-party services that may collect and process your data, including:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600">
        <li>Google Analytics and Google AdSense</li>
        <li>Affiliate networks (e.g., Amazon Associates, ShareASale/AWIN) when you click affiliate links</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Each third party has its own privacy policy governing how they use your data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Depending on your location, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information. You can opt out of personalized advertising via <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="text-gray-700 underline hover:text-gray-900" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. For inquiries about your data, please <a href="/contact" class="text-gray-700 underline hover:text-gray-900">contact us</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Data Security</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        We implement reasonable measures to protect your information. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Children&apos;s Privacy</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Our website is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post the updated policy on this page with a new &quot;Last updated&quot; date.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please <a href="/contact" class="text-gray-700 underline hover:text-gray-900">contact us</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-gray-500">
        Last updated: February 2026
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
